Arc T8, the last stage. THIS SHIPS A DECISION NOT TO BUILD SOMETHING, and the
decision was made by a pre-registration, not by judgement at the end.

`untrusted_input` asserts that a party on the far side of the boundary had a say
in a value. It does NOT assert the far side authored the bytes. Of the 324
catalogue names that mint the label, 24 return a value merely CHOSEN from a
constrained set -- accept's peer address in seven languages, erlang's inet DNS
answers, the exit status from os.wait*. A finding rooted at one can only ever be
a SELECTION finding, never an injected payload, so a claim whose question is
injection reads a stronger fact than the label states.

THE CANDIDATE FIX WAS A PER-ROW `value_shape` FIELD, AND IT IS DECLINED ON ITS
OWN PRE-REGISTERED RULE. WI-jivih fixed the threshold BEFORE any number existed:
under a 5% finding-weighted share, the field is not worth its cost. A
23-repository cohort sampled DELIBERATELY for socket ownership -- chosen to be
maximally favourable to the property -- returned:

    chains                 11,959
    choice-shaped chains        70
    findings                   568
    CHOICE-SHAPED FINDINGS       2     = 0.35%

An order of magnitude under the line. AND IT IS NOT ONE OF THE EARLIER VOID
ZEROS: this corpus SEES the population -- 87% of it reaches a choice-shaped
chain across 12 primitives and 6 languages. The rows are found, resolved and
walked; they simply do not become findings. All three terms measured, none
inferred:

    PRESENCE      29.8% of eligible repositories carry the call site
    REACHABILITY  87% of a socket-owning cohort reach it in a chain
    FINDINGS      0.4% of evidence rows are rooted at one

That is this project's own PRESENCE != REACHABILITY != TRUTH rule with every
term filled in for the first time. Honouring a falsifier you named is the whole
point of naming it, so the field is not built.

WHAT RULE 1 FOUND, WHICH NARROWED THE WORK AGAIN. The blindness was ALREADY
documented at docs/hypergumbo-spec.md -- but phrased as pending ("Until it
exists, read source_primitive"), carrying no measurement, and living only in the
spec while the arc's exit criterion asks for a DATED, USER-VISIBLE declared
blindness. So this converts it: the paragraph now says DECLINED, dated, with the
number; and a `violated` verdict whose evidence sits on such a source carries
the new `choice_shaped_source` caveat naming the primitives.

IT RIDES THE VIOLATED PATH, ALONE AMONG THE CAVEATS HERE. Every other caveat in
this module qualifies a CLEAN verdict, where the risk is a false all-clear. This
one qualifies a REPORTED finding, because that is where this blindness costs the
reader something -- a selection finding reads identically to an injected
payload. Disclosure only: the verdict VALUE and evidence_count are untouched, so
nothing moves between confirmed and violated.

The vocabulary is declared once, in CHOICE_SHAPED_SOURCE_NAMES, rather than
copied into the lab instrument that measured it.

